hypothesis: Structural, and the weakest prior of the five. wunderfund's best was a
  SINGLE-layer GRU at hidden 256. Every model in this project except v001 has used
  2 layers. But capacity moves have failed repeatedly here (v045 2x wider +0.0002,
  v026/v027 2x and 4x larger, negative), and removing a layer is a capacity reduction,
  so this may simply lose. Included because it is the one structural knob wunderfund
  identified as best and it has literally never been tested at hidden 128.
